I've just removed all noralujv votes from the database.  This means that 

http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/needed/valsi/en.html

is now very much bigger, as is 

http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/needed/natlang/en.html



I would very much like people to spend some time walking these lists and
formulating alternative definitions (or voting for the ones there, on
the off chance that they don't suck).  If you speak languages other than
English, though, it might be better if you worked on those other
languages instead.

With everybody working on this, we'll be very close to a Lojban <->
English dictionary worth publishing.

If you don't have a jbovlaste account, but feel competent to work on
this sort of thing, please send me an e-mail.

Thanks.

